;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The time limit: until the landslide is cleared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know how long that takes, but before it's done I have to have the whole Motoki-cho group in my hands.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Confining the Motoki-cho group is to keep <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s hands off the four of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Motoki-cho group knows more about <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> than the residents of Arata do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> would leave these four alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I might as well pretend to have surrendered to <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> and take the four of them into my own keeping.<PG>
Right now <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> and the others are 'waking' new corpses and clearing the path to that hut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I manage to confine the four in the hut after that, if one of the corpses ends up guarding the Motoki-cho group, keeping the four safe will be hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ideally, I'd meant to get the four away toward Toyotake the moment they were all together at the hut, but―<PG>
If I can get hold of falsificaso here, and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and I drop out of the Droga-infected, <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can't watch us from afar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Escaping would get fairly easy, but using falsificaso takes a syringe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if one would conveniently be lying under the secret base...<PG>
I have to admit the situation is pretty grim.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, winning <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s trust counts for a lot, and to keep the four safe, it's better after all to put them under my watch than to leave them in the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, the only one who can negotiate with <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is me.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
All right, let me go over what I'm going to do now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Confine the Motoki-cho group in the abandoned hut
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Go to the settlement and urge the residents (<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> especially) to surrender to <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Slip out of the settlement before hearing <STYLE ID="4">Dad's</STYLE> decision (so <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> doesn't learn it)
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Find falsificaso and inject myself
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Inject <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> with falsificaso too, and get the four out of the hut<PG>
Honestly, it's hard to call it a perfect plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> probably can't pinpoint where anyone is except me and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, but if it wanted to, it could at least block the mountain path.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, I don't know how far <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can reach.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> seems to be under this whole mountain area, but if I knew its exact range...<PG>
But there's no time to waver, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once the landslide is cleared, a horde of corpses will probably come to the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then there'll be no escaping anymore.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I climbed up from the stream and reached the graveyard clearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone... is there.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were walking with their eyes on the ground, as if searching the graveyard clearing for dropped coins.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they're checking the ground of the graveyard clearing―
{PAUSE ""}
have they noticed that the corpses are moving?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, they must have checked the memo and the audio I left.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crouching, I called to <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> 10 meters away at the lowest volume I could.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... Quiet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put a finger to my lips, signaling her not to let <STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE> notice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I went back a little way along the path I'd come by and hid in the shadow of a tree beside the path to the stream.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...! You're safe!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now I'm being watched.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now I'm <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s servant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
I'm sorry!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Ugh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬土下座逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I jabbed <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> in the pit of the stomach while she was off guard and doubled her over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya... chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... what are you doing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>At once, I brought my mouth close to <STYLE ID="5">Auntie's</STYLE> ear.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, listen carefully. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">We can't defy </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Head for the abandoned hut out toward Toyotake."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> knows I'm being watched, she should catch my true meaning, if only vaguely.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ugh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Come on, don't dawdle. There's no time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grabbed <STYLE ID="5">Auntie's</STYLE> arm hard and tried to pull her to her feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't think I'd hit her all that hard, but she wouldn't get up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly my <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE> took a hard <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="おうだ">blow</STYLE>, and I saw a flicker like fireworks in front of my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―far too strong for a <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="おうだ">blow</STYLE> of the fist.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If you so much as touch </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I won't go easy on anyone...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> had kicked me in the face, it seemed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So not a shred of my true meaning got through with that, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt blood trickle from the corner of my mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, this isn't a game. Do as I say."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Not defy </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, so you're already past saving too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Or is what I'm looking at already a corpse?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... The soldiers who have become corpses are far stronger than this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Defy them, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> won't get off lightly either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬棒.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="5">then I'll protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> myself!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬棒振り上げ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE> picked up a tree branch at her feet and swung at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\剣衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "20" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I caught it with the knife I'd drawn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE>, too, had passed the mountain seclusion 20 years ago and married <STYLE ID="10">Uncle</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Worn out as I was, she wasn't an opponent I could fight while just putting on a show.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬棒.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... You have a tree branch, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">; I have a well-honed knife. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">You can see which of us has the advantage, can't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
