<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Uncle</STYLE> appeared from the shadow of a tree, his eyes on the fallen.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"There was a suspicion, you see, that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'d gotten blood on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> on purpose. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">If you'd gotten it on those three just now as well, we'd have taken it that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> were trying to </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> us, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">was I wrong?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"N-no, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, I'd never </STYLE><STYLE ID="22" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> you and Mom...!</STYLE>
