<STYLE ID="7">Besides―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Well, fine, it's fine, no need for excuses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Now then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">... let's have a little talk, shall we?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Uncle's</STYLE> eyes were unmistakably those of suspicion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="23" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> them was impossible after all...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Well, let me tell you our true intentions first... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, as you said, isolating the Motoki-cho group was a very good idea. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">If word of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> reaches the residents, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s existence becomes public to the whole world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> only wants to live quietly here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">For that, we had to isolate those girls and get rid of your blood, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Otherwise we'd have had to kill them all at once."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"N-no...! I'd never defy </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Now, now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, what you intended doesn't matter. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">What mattered was how quickly we reached the goal. </STYLE>
