{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> getting </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> blood all over them was a nuisance, true... but well, the isolation succeeded."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Mm... I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="22" RUBY="だま">was being deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Who can say?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　Whether </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> were really </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> or just lost the game of bluff with us, I don't know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, if you really meant to work with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, you should be glad of this outcome―or am I wrong?"</STYLE><PG>
Completely... outplayed...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
