{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, it seems, was seeing several moves further ahead than I was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"So far, everything has gone as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> planned. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">The real goal was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> alone, but for that―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Oops, let's keep the rest a secret for now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
