{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, there's nothing more I can do.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh, and I'll tell you now: </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> blood only works if it touches us or </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> right after it's shed. </STYLE>
